BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Flow - Premiere
DTSTART:20260606T020000Z
DTEND:20260606T034000Z
DTSTAMP:20260606T020000Z
UID:feOLpdEusj
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 85 mins (1h25m)\n\nPresented by Flow Producers Ale
 na Rainsberry\, Denisa Krásná\, and Grace Gorman Explore the journeys o
 f women in adventure sports as they move through the world on water\, rock
 \, and in the sky\, at the world premiere of the inspiring new documentary
 \, Flow. To celebrate the premiere\, creators and co-producers Alena Rai
 nsberry and Denisa Krásná will present the film in person! Their book "
 Flow: Women’s Counternarratives from Rivers\, Rock\, and Sky" will be av
 ailable for purchase.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/flow-prem
 iere\n\nEstimated start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
